%% IMPORTANT: This is the demo architecture showing how you can write in the MMD file.
%% You must follow this rule and write like this.

sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor Witness
    actor Officer as Investigation Officer
    participant NLU as Module 1: NLU Parser
    participant Enc as Module 2: Encoder
    participant Gen as Module 3: Generator
    participant Rend as Module 4: Sketch Renderer
    
    Witness->>Officer: Verbal Description
    Officer->>NLU: Inputs Text String
    NLU->>NLU: Parses text into JSON attributes
    NLU->>Enc: Sends JSON Map
    Enc->>Enc: Projects attributes to StyleGAN Latent Space
    Enc->>Gen: Sends Latent Vector (w)
    Gen->>Gen: Generates Photo-realistic Face
    Gen->>Rend: Sends Photo
    Rend->>Rend: Converts Photo to Forensic Pencil Sketch
    Rend->>Officer: Displays Forensic Sketch
    Officer->>Witness: Shows Sketch for Review
    Witness-->>Officer: Feedback: "Make eyes smaller, age older"
    Officer->>NLU: Inputs modifications